  "contract": "A book opens the class trainer window for the viewer's own class instead of a gossip page (mod-spellbook, #4174; npcflag 48 on every class-training book). Training there restores a missing eligible class ability without teaching higher-level ranks: Venom Bolt 800869 (class spell, level 1) is listed as trainable once it is missing and is learned when trained, while its rank 2 502870 (level 8) is listed as unavailable to a level-1 character and is refused. Training again is harmless. A level-20 character holding Alkahest 504342 (the tree's rank) is sold rank 2 504714 (level 20) but not rank 3 504715 (level 26). Class abilities also remain automatic on login. Prices are charged, so both characters are given a purse.",
